ton et al. [38] and explained in-depth by Baldi et al. [39]. During
each training case, the algorithm will randomly omit half of thefeature detectors in order to prevent complex co-adaptations on
the training data and enhance the generalization ability. This
method was further improved in [40 –45]. Speci ﬁcally, research by
